    "Several positive contexts are cirrhosis-modified (tolfenamic acid, encainide, isradipine) and may overestimate F in a no-condition setting; isradipine healthy F is 16% (C39), but structural transfer is low.",
    "Nilotinib F is an assumed value and is precipitation-limited; MK-8628 is qualitative.",
    "No L2 records were available for the esaxerenone fed or glasdegib contexts."
